Error [E-WEB-ABI-TYPE]: `Point` cannot cross the JS/WASM boundary on a `@WasmExport` parameter
  --> tests/ui/web_abi_type.jet:4:4
    |
  4 | fn export_bad(p: Point) -> Int {
    |    ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: web exports and imports only admit ABI-safe types (scalars, `String`, `List`/`Map` of ABI-safe values, and `@[Codable]` structs/enums per D-JSBIND1)
 Fix: use a scalar, `String`, a `List`/`Map` of ABI-safe values, or a `@[Codable]` struct/enum whose fields are ABI-safe (D-JSBIND1)
